sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant RL as Rate Limiter
    participant SH as Security Headers
    participant BR as Brain Router
    participant P as LLM Provider

    C->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions
    GW->>Auth: Validate Bearer token
    Auth-->>GW: Authorized
    GW->>RL: Check rate limit
    RL-->>GW: Within limits
    GW->>SH: Apply security headers
    SH-->>GW: Headers set

    GW->>BR: ChatCompletion(request)
    BR->>BR: Route by model name
    BR->>P: Complete(messages)
    P-->>BR: LLM response
    BR-->>GW: Internal response

    alt Streaming requested
        GW-->>C: SSE stream (chunked)
    else Non-streaming
        GW->>GW: Compress (Brotli/gzip)
        GW-->>C: JSON response
    end
